Package: mpv-iris
Version: 8.0.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: ffmpeg-iris, mpv
Description: mpv launcher wired to the IRIS-patched FFmpeg hardware-decode path
 Provides /usr/bin/mpv-iris, an mpv launcher that loads the IRIS-patched FFmpeg
 libraries from ffmpeg-iris and forces the P010 DRM-Prime / v4l2-mem2mem
 hardware-decode profile on the Qualcomm SM8150 VPU of the Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu).
 .
 The system mpv is left untouched; only this launcher uses the patched tree.
